# IBT Agent API Testing Scripts
# Start the server: uvicorn src.main:app --reload --port 8000

### Health Check (Ping)
GET http://localhost:8000/IbtAgent/v2/ping

###

### Process Benefits Query (Direct Mode)
POST http://localhost:8000/IbtAgent/v2/invocations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userPrompt": "What are my dental benefits?",
  "sessionId": "sess-001",
  "context": {
    "userName": "John Doe",
    "userType": "member",
    "productId": "1",
    "source": "DXAIService",
    "promptId": "p-123"
  }
}

###

